  "_comment.teblade.item.slashblade": "—————————— 拔刀剑 ——————————",
  "item.teblade.fox_looking_for_edge_of_groundedge": "狐月刀「大地之边」",
  "item.teblade.fox_looking_for_edge_of_groundedge.desc": "大地の閾にいつかは立つと 信じてる",
  "item.teblade.fragmented_slashblade": "碎刃「」",
  "item.teblade.fragmented_slashblade.desc": "碎裂之刃",
  "item.teblade.rainshower": "骤雨「狭间」",
  "item.teblade.rainshower.desc": "雨丝细密地闪耀着，缓缓垂落\n在夕照残阳的辉映之中\n旅人踽踽独行，沿着蜿蜒小径\n怀揣着一颗郁暗的心。",
  "item.teblade.yamato_dread_storm": "阎魔刀「畏怖风暴」",
  "item.teblade.yamato_dread_storm.desc": "风暴已至……",

  "_comment.teblade.item.slashblade.thaumaturge": "—————————— Thaumaturge 联动拔刀剑 ——————————",
  "item.teblade.greatwood_dummy": "无铭刀「宏伟之木偶」",
  "item.teblade.greatwood_dummy.desc": "以宏伟木制成的无铭之刃，刃艺的起点。",
  "item.teblade.silverwood_saya": "名刀「银树白鞘」",
  "item.teblade.silverwood_saya.desc": "银树为鞘，灵木藏锋。",
  "item.teblade.rodai_blood": "妖刀「血腥」",
  "item.teblade.rodai_blood.desc": "以血为引，饥渴不息。",
  "item.teblade.rodai_blood_earth": "血腥之刃「后土」",
  "item.teblade.rodai_blood_earth.desc": "以血为引，饥渴不息。\n厚土承锋，震裂尘寰。",
  "item.teblade.rodai_blood_flame": "血腥之刃「炽心」",
  "item.teblade.rodai_blood_flame.desc": "以血为引，饥渴不息。\n炽心不熄，余烬复燃。",
  "item.teblade.rodai_blood_growth": "血腥之刃「句芒」",
  "item.teblade.rodai_blood_growth.desc": "以血为引，饥渴不息。\n春生于刃，枯木逢荣。",
  "item.teblade.rodai_blood_sky": "血腥之刃「苍穹」",
  "item.teblade.rodai_blood_sky.desc": "以血为引，饥渴不息。\n一线苍穹，锋过长空。",
  "item.teblade.rodai_blood_thunder": "血腥之刃「风雷」",
  "item.teblade.rodai_blood_thunder.desc": "以血为引，饥渴不息。\n风起雷行，三闪留痕。",
  "item.teblade.rodai_blood_tide": "血腥之刃「奔流」",
  "item.teblade.rodai_blood_tide.desc": "以血为引，饥渴不息。\n潮来复去，奔流不息。",
  "item.teblade.rodai_mystery": "利刃「神秘」",
